#. module: l10n_sk_withholding
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_withholding/models/withholding.py:0
msgid ""
"Confirm that no other resident withholding titles are missing from row 01. "
"This adapter covers dividends and author income only."
msgstr ""
"Potvrďte, že v riadku 01 nechýbajú iné rezidentské zrážkové tituly. Tento "
"adaptér pokrýva iba dividendy a autorské príjmy."

#. module: l10n_sk_withholding
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_withholding.field_l10n_sk_withholding__cssk_export_warnings
msgid ""
"Content checks that did not block the last export but need a look before "
"filing, one per line. Refreshed on every export; empty when the last export "
"raised none."
msgstr ""
"Kontroly obsahu, ktoré posledný export nezablokovali, ale pred podaním si "
"ich treba pozrieť, každá na samostatnom riadku. Obnovujú sa pri každom "
"exporte; prázdne, ak posledný export žiadne nenašiel."

#. module: l10n_sk_withholding
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_withholding.field_l10n_sk_withholding__correction_source_reference
